    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand sports festival of spirits, held once every hundred years... is now open!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A competitive racing game where you compete in two separate lanes, top and bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies in &quot;Parry&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an enemy appears, jump! While in the air, press the jump button again... Let's Parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies are sealed in the Parry stock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pressing the launch button, you can fire the &quot;Obstruction Cannon&quot; at your opponent's lane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send defeated obstructions back and disrupt your opponent's run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally! There is a new &quot;Bread Eating Competition Mode&quot; where you compete to see who can eat more bread before reaching the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*More characters and courses are planned to be added in future updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand sports festival of spirits, held once every hundred years... is now open!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A competitive racing game where you compete in two separate lanes, top and bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies in &quot;Parry&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an enemy appears, jump! While in the air, press the jump button again... Let's Parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies are sealed in the Parry stock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pressing the launch button, you can fire the &quot;Obstruction Cannon&quot; at your opponent's lane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send defeated obstructions back and disrupt your opponent's run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally! There is a new &quot;Bread Eating Competition Mode&quot; where you compete to see who can eat more bread before reaching the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*More characters and courses are planned to be added in future updates.</p>",
    "short_description": "A grand sports festival of spirits held once every hundred years... Here it begins!! A competitive racing game where you compete in two separate lanes! The key to victory lies in &quot;Parry&quot;! When an enemy appears, jump! While in the air, press the jump button again... Let's Parry!",
